Package: SMdocs
Title: Sustainability Metrics Analysis and Visualization Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: 
    person("Christopher", "Donovan", , "christopher.donovan@uvm.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for analyzing and visualizing
    sustainability metrics data. Provides functions for data processing,
    normalization, statistical analysis, and visualization of
    multidimensional sustainability indicators. Includes specialized tools
    for creating interactive tables, radar charts, regression analysis,
    and distribution plots tailored for sustainability assessment
    frameworks.
